  "status": "data contract and first bounded crop; not wired into the scene",
  "authority": "Real geography supplies geometry and heights only. Every name, use, tenant, person and story in the game is invented and lives in the city lore, never in this region's data. The authored McCluster City district and its HQ island are fictional overlays, not surveyed geography.",
